---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Economy for Everyone">
  <section class="prose-e4e">
    <div class="ledger-header">
      <h2 class="title-reset">About</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      Economy for Everyone was built to connect lived experience, institutional behavior, and
      economic outcomes in language that is actionable and human.
    </p>
    <p>
      This project uses a narrative-first approach: personal stakes first, then structural analysis,
      then practical action.
    </p>
    <p>
      Start with the <a href="/origin-story">origin story</a> for the why behind the framework.
    </p>

    <div class="ledger-header">
      <h3 class="title-reset">Contribute</h3>
    </div>
    <p>
      The best way to contribute is by opening an issue in the
      <a href="https://github.com/chrislyons-dev/economyforeveryone/issues"
        >Economy for Everyone GitHub repo</a
      >. Include the claim, source, and why it matters.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can also reach out by email:
      <a href="mailto:contribute@economyforeveryone.org">contribute@economyforeveryone.org</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
